<Legal updated="November 2026" title="Pricing" description="Krylabs prices: the iOS App Audit and 30-minute call, client projects, free and paid products, subscriptions and taxes.">

  <p>Krylabs offers a mix of free and paid products. Pricing is shown at the point of purchase and may vary by region and platform. Subscriptions purchased through the App Store or Google Play are billed by Apple or Google.</p>

  <h2>How pricing works</h2>
  <p>Each product is priced independently. Free apps may offer optional in-app purchases or subscriptions that unlock additional features. Current prices are always displayed in-app or on the product's page before you pay.</p>

  <h2>Fixed-price offers</h2>
  <p>Two offers have a set price, in US dollars, paid by card at <a href="/pay/">krylabs.com/pay</a>:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>iOS App Audit: {dollars(OFFERS.audit.cents)}.</strong> A written review of an existing iOS app, delivered within a week.</li>
    <li><strong>30-minute call: {dollars(OFFERS.call.cents)}</strong> (regularly {dollars(OFFERS.call.was)}). A video call about your app.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Client projects</h2>
  <p>Other iOS work for clients is quoted individually after a conversation about the app, and
  invoiced by email. The written estimate splits the work into milestones, and each milestone is
  invoiced when it is delivered, so the full amount is never due upfront. Fixed-scope work, such as
  adding a Live Activity to an existing app, has a price that is agreed in writing before work
  starts. <a class="link" href="/#faq">How projects are priced</a>.</p>

  <h2>Payments in India</h2>
  <p>Invoiced work for clients in India is billed in <strong>Indian Rupees (₹ INR)</strong>, through
  invoices and payment links issued via RBI-authorised payment aggregators such as Razorpay. The
  exact amount payable, and what it covers, is always stated on the invoice or payment page before
  you pay, with no hidden fees. Where a product offers purchases directly on our
  websites or apps (for example, event reservations), the price is displayed the same way before
  you confirm payment.</p>

  <h2>Taxes</h2>
  <p>Prices may be exclusive of applicable taxes, which are calculated and shown at checkout where relevant.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>For pricing questions, email <a href="mailto:info.krylabs@gmail.com">info.krylabs@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</Legal>
